{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sabbatical in Merzouga</strong> is a visual novel where you play as a student on a sabbatical. Explore the city of Merzouga and discover a creature that haunts you at night.<br>The choices you make will determine the ending of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short branching narrative with player choices that shape the flow of the dream.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 dream nights where you interact with the worm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains all 8 different endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric background art of the cabin, desert, and worm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle sound design and music to heighten the mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: around 10\u201315 minutes for one complete run on any ending.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4010330?t=1761307204","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4010330?t=1761307204","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010330/f10bf0a652c260f3d898c72a5f87a0be39e36b9d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761307204","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010330/f10bf0a652c260f3d898c72a5f87a0be39e36b9d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761307204","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4012820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sabbatical in Merzouga</strong> is a visual novel where you play as a student on a sabbatical. Explore the city of Merzouga and discover a creature that haunts you at night.<br>The choices you make will determine the ending of the story.</p